Z||000011||EdsB52||10-03-2001||11:47 AM||||What the f....   By writing, "Oh, do you pay people to wipe your ass also?!" I was fabricating a dig on rich people, not Hugh. How could anyone read into that, anything defamatory about Hugh. Hugh wrote something about rich people being the same as him or the rest of us if he invisioned them sitting on the crapper. Well, with my question I rose the comedic proposition that Hugh would have had to pay someone to wipe his ass to be like rich people. I certainly was not flaming Hugh and I would not defend rich people's neurotic habits or 'better than thou' lifestyles.<P>By the way JSocha, the "comment" in question was a rhetorical question. A question due to the presence of a question mark; rhetorical due to the exclamation mark and obvious non-inquiring nature of the question. So BS to you too.||||reg||1
Z||000012||frontal lobe||10-03-2001||12:15 PM||||In an attempt to get this back on the light-hearted track that it was...to EdsB52 and Hugh:<P>When you get old enough, you don't have to be rich to get people to wipe your behind--medicare will pay for it.  'Course, by then you are eating creamed green peas instead of pate and caviar!||||reg||1
Z||000013||JSocha||10-03-2001||12:24 PM||||Oh!  Thank you for that clarification Ed, if not to me then to the general populace here.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"><P>However, I still personally feel the original comment you made above still reflects a sense of   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_bs.gif"> , no matter what rationale now has been placed behind it by you to justify stating it as it is, in the form it had been presented in the first place.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>Funny thing is, I recall somebody else recently in another thread apologizing to you after you commented to his post, as you apparently must have read into it far more then I (or perhaps anyone else for that matter) did, for something, which in my opinion, was less to not offensive at all in the first place.<P>Hint:  Arizona Dreamy Draw Dam Thread...when somebody asked for your "help/assistance" since you were in the area as well.<P>Now compare the specific comment of that thread asking for assistance to the way you have your comment above shown here and ask yourself, who is going to find the "comedic proposition" that you wanted to relay with the way it is specifically presented above.<P>Ed, just so you understand, I am not trying to get into a "p*ssing" match with you or against you, as it is definately unnecessary, even if it appears to you that way or that I am, because I am not.<P>I am only commenting on the way the comment itself is presented and it just does not stand well or reflect the "comic" intention that you may feel you had.  <P>It looks to me as a personal attack on Hugh who originally made a comment.  <P>And by the way Hugh responded, it's apparent he did not see the humor in it as well and may have taken it as an attack against him.<P>Just my 2 cents Ed, take it and or leave it.<p>[This message has been edited by JSocha (edited 10-03-2001).]||||reg||9
